OL,3,GNEWSAJojo the gorilla has spent his
OL,4,Alife alone. Can he finally find a
OL,5,Acompanion?
OL,6,
OL,7,FJojo the gorilla has spent his life
OL,8,Falone. Can he finally find a companion?
OL,10,FIn 2015, a young male gorilla named
OL,11,FJojo took his first tentative steps
OL,12,Fonto grass.
OL,14,FUntil that moment, the 11-year-old ape
OL,15,Fhad spent almost his entire life in a
OL,16,Ftiny cage at a private zoo in Gabon,
OL,17,Fafter being taken from the wild as an
OL,18,Finfant. His family had been killed by
OL,19,Fthe poachers who took him.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
