OL,3,GNEWSAJojo the gorilla has spent his
OL,4,Alife alone. Can he finally find a
OL,5,Acompanion?
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than a decade later, Jojo is
OL,8,Fsettled into a sanctuary ` but he still
OL,9,Flives alone. He hasn't had a family
OL,10,Fsince he was taken, or indeed any
OL,11,Fgorilla friends.
